# postgres:16-alpine (database and backup): the Go standard library inside gosu, the helper that drops root once when the
# container starts. gosu makes no network connection and parses no outside input, so neither flaw can be reached. Fixed when
# the official image rebuilds gosu. Reviewed 2026-11-08 by Eng. Vincent J. Maro; look again 2026-12-08.
